@newman exclude not yet passed live: the commit is run by BulkJobRunner, and tests/integration/ci/seed.sh starts no worker for that class (adding it there would also run the jobs the bulk-jobs section of the api collection pauses while running). Drop this marker after a first green run on a stack with that worker.

records-bulk-transition task 2.1: `POST /api/bulk-jobs` with `openregister:transition`. Seeds its own register and a schema whose lifecycle declares `start` (ontvangen to in_behandeling) and `sluiten` (in_behandeling to afgesloten, required input `reden`). One job moves three objects through `start`: one in `ontvangen` is applied, one already `in_behandeling` is skipped, one in `afgesloten` fails with the engine's refusal, and the preview moves nothing. A second job runs `sluiten` without `reden`: the object fails with the missing-input message and stays where it was. An anonymous caller gets 401, and bad parameters 400.

Everything it creates is removed in `99 teardown`.
